  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "交通安全專論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON TRAFFIC SAFETY",
    "describe_ch": "探討影響駕駛安全的可能因素，以及這些因素影響駕駛安全的程度，包括人、車、路與環境的各種情況變化，主要的內容可涵蓋：安全概論、駕駛安全之系統分析、促進駕駛安全的改善順序、事故鑑定與駕駛安全、環境和路的因素與駕駛安全及易肇事地點診斷、車的因素與駕駛安全及車輛審驗標準、人的因素與駕駛安全─優良駕駛行為與訓練、交通政策與駕駛環境、英文期刊導讀、酒精濃度實驗、國外經驗借鏡、研究駕駛安全相關問卷之設計、評價改善措施或制度優劣之方法、不當駕駛行為之前因與後果。",
    "describe_eh": "To discuss possible affecting factors of driving safety, and the degrees of influence, including a variety of situational changes regarding human, vehicle, roadway and environment. Major contents involve safety introduction, system analysis about driving safety, priority of enhancing driving safety, accident authentication and driving safety, environment and roadway factors connecting to driving safety, diagnosis on accident prone sites, vehicle factors relating to driving safety, standards of vehicle audition, human factors resulting in driving safety, excellent driving behaviors and training, traffic policies against driving environment, guide to English periodical, testing of alcohol concentration, experience from other countries, design of questionnaire evaluating driving safety, assessment of countermeasures, method studying pros or cons of a system, cause and effect of an inappropriate driving behavior.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
